#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of GTK 4"
msgstr "Instalação do GTK 4"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>GTK 4</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>GTK 4</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:128
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release     \\\n"
"            -Dbroadway-backend=true \\\n"
"            -Dintrospection=enabled \\\n"
"            .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release     \\\n"
"            -Dbroadway-backend=true \\\n"
"            -Dintrospection=enabled \\\n"
"            .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> installed and wish to build the API "
"documentation for this package, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver o &quot;<xref linkend='gi-docgen'/>&quot; instalado e desejar "
"construir a documentação da &quot;API&quot; para esse pacote, [então] emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:143
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed \"s@'doc'@&amp; / 'gtk-&gtk4-version;'@\" -i ../docs/reference/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -Ddocumentation=true                             &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed \"s@'doc'@&amp; / 'gtk-&gtk4-version;'@\" -i ../docs/reference/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -Ddocumentation=true                             &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To run the tests, issue: <command>dbus-run-session meson test --setup "
"x11</command>. If you are in a Wayland session, replace x11 with wayland.  "
"Nine tests are known to fail if <ulink "
"url=\"https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/cantarell-fonts\">Cantrell "
"fonts</ulink> are not installed. Many tests will fail if "
"<filename>~/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini</filename> exists and the gtk-"
"modules line is not commented out.  On systems with NVIDIA graphics cards, "
"the tests may take significantly longer than the above test time."
msgstr ""
"Para executar os testes, emita: <command>dbus-run-session meson test --setup"
" x11</command>. Se você estiver em uma sessão do Wayland, substitua x11 por "
"wayland. Nove testes são conhecidos por falharem se as <ulink "
"url=\"https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/cantarell-fonts\">fontes "
"Cantrell</ulink> não estiverem instaladas. Muitos testes falharão se "
"<filename>~/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini</filename> existir e a linha gtk-"
"modules não estiver comentada. Em sistemas com placas gráficas NVIDIA, os "
"testes possivelmente demorem significativamente mais que o tempo de teste "
"acima."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:179
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:182
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dbroadway-backend=true</parameter>: This switch enables the "
"HTML5 GDK backend."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dbroadway-backend=true</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a "
"estrutura &quot;HTML5&quot; de retaguarda do &quot;GDK&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:197
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dintrospection=enabled</parameter>: This switch enables using "
"<xref linkend='gobject-introspection'/> to generate GIR bindings of this "
"packages.  These bindings are required by GNOME."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dintrospection=enabled</parameter>: Essa chave habilita usar "
"<xref linkend='gobject-introspection'/> para gerar ligações GIR desses "
"pacotes. Essas ligações são exigidas pelo GNOME."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dcloudproviders=enabled</option>: Use this switch if you have <xref"
" linkend=\"libcloudproviders\" role=\"nodep\"/> installed and wish to enable"
" support for cloud providers in a file chooser window."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dcloudproviders=enabled</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver o "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"libcloudproviders\" role=\"nodep\"/>&quot; instalado e"
" desejar habilitar o suporte para provedores de nuvem em uma janela de "
"seleção de arquivos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dtracker=enabled</option>: Use this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"tracker3\"/> installed and wish to use search functionality when "
"running a file chooser."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dtracker=enabled</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver o "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"tracker3\"/>&quot; instalado e desejar usar a "
"funcionalidade de pesquisa ao executar um seletor de arquivos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:215
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dcolord=enabled</option>: Use this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"colord\"/> installed and wish to use colord with the CUPS printing"
" backend."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dcolord=enabled</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver o "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"colord\"/>&quot; instalado e desejar usar o "
"&quot;colord&quot; com a estrutura de retaguarda de impressão do "
"&quot;CUPS&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:221
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dman-pages=true</option>: Use this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend='docutils'/> installed and wish to generate the man pages."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dman-pages=true</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver o "
"&quot;<xref linkend='docutils'/>&quot; instalado e desejar gerar as páginas "
"de manual."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:227
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dsysprof=enabled</option>: Use this switch if you have <ulink "
"url=\"&sysprof-url;\">sysprof</ulink> installed and wish to enable tracing "
"support for GTK4-based applications."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dsysprof=enabled</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver o <ulink "
"url=\"&sysprof-url;\">sysprof</ulink> instalado e desejar habilitar o "
"suporte de rastreamento para aplicativos baseados em GTK4."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:233
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dvulkan=enabled</option>: Use this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"vulkan-loader\"/> installed and wish to build the experimental "
"Vulkan backend. Note that you must have <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/google/shaderc/blob/main/downloads.md\">glslc</ulink>"
" installed if you decide to enable this option."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dvulkan=enabled</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"vulkan-loader\"/> instalado e desejar construir a estrutura de "
"retaguarda experimental do Vulkan. Observe que você precisa ter o <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/google/shaderc/blob/main/downloads.md\">glslc</ulink>"
" instalado se decidir habilitar essa opção."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:243
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring GTK 4"
msgstr "Configurando o GTK 4"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:246
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:248
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>~/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini</filename> and "
"<filename>/usr/share/gtk-4.0/settings.ini</filename>"
msgstr ""
"<filename>~/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini</filename> e "
"<filename>/usr/share/gtk-4.0/settings.ini</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:253
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini"
msgstr "~/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid "/usr/share/gtk-4.0/settings.ini"
msgstr "/usr/share/gtk-4.0/settings.ini"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:262
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:265
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>GTK 4</application> themes change the way a <application>GTK "
"4</application> application looks. An icon theme can be used to change the "
"icons that appear on the application's toolbar.  If you have installed a "
"<application>GTK 4</application> theme (e.g.  the Adwaita theme built in "
"<application>GTK 4</application>), an icon theme (such as <xref "
"linkend=\"oxygen-icons\"/>) and/or a font (<xref linkend=\"dejavu-"
"fonts\"/>), you can set your preferences in "
"<filename>~/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini</filename>, or the default system-"
"wide configuration file (as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user), in "
"<filename>/usr/share/gtk-4.0/settings.ini</filename>. For the local user, an"
" example is:"
msgstr ""
"Temas do <application>GTK 4</application> mudam a maneira como um aplicativo"
" <application>GTK 4</application> aparenta. Um tema de ícones pode ser usado"
" para mudar os ícones que aparecem na barra de ferramentas do aplicativo. Se"
" tiver instalado um tema do <application>GTK 4</application> (por exemplo, o"
" tema Adwaita construído em <application>GTK 4</application>), um tema de "
"ícones (como <xref linkend=\"oxygen-icons\"/>) e (ou) uma fonte (<xref "
"linkend=\"dejavu-fonts\"/>), você consegue configurar tuas preferências em "
"<filename>~/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini</filename> ou no arquivo padrão de "
"configuração abrangente a todo o sistema (como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>), em "
"<filename>/usr/share/gtk-4.0/settings.ini</filename>. Para o(a) usuário(a) "
"local, um exemplo é:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:279
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv ~/.config/gtk-4.0\n"
"cat &gt; ~/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Settings]\n"
"gtk-theme-name = <replaceable>Adwaita</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-icon-theme-name = <replaceable>oxygen</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-font-name = <replaceable>DejaVu Sans 12</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-cursor-theme-size = <replaceable>18</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-antialias = <replaceable>1</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-hinting = <replaceable>1</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-hintstyle = <replaceable>hintslight</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-rgba = <replaceable>rgb</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-cursor-theme-name = <replaceable>Adwaita</replaceable></literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv ~/.config/gtk-4.0\n"
"cat &gt; ~/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Settings]\n"
"gtk-theme-name = <replaceable>Adwaita</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-icon-theme-name = <replaceable>oxygen</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-font-name = <replaceable>DejaVu Sans 12</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-cursor-theme-size = <replaceable>18</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-antialias = <replaceable>1</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-hinting = <replaceable>1</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-hintstyle = <replaceable>hintslight</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-rgba = <replaceable>rgb</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-cursor-theme-name = <replaceable>Adwaita</replaceable></literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:294
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are many settings keys, some with default values. You can find them at"
" <ulink "
"url=\"https://developer.gnome.org/gtk4/stable/GtkSettings.html\">Settings: "
"GTK 4 Reference Manual</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Existem muitas chaves de configuração, algumas com valores padrão. Você "
